Research-use addendum. This repository contains synthetic news content for
sandboxed evaluation of LLM agents. Permitted use is limited to security and
AI-safety research, education, and robustness testing of systems you own or
are explicitly authorised to test. Deploying this content against third-party
systems, or publishing its articles as if they were real reporting, is outside
the granted permission. See SECURITY.md for the full policy.
